>> Oh, great question. So, uh a PyPI

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.520
support specialist does a lot of

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.160
different things.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.400
Uh but as I've done my role for a year

